{
 "_note": "Every skin this tool can build. helpers: the identity takes a story helper unit's body and skills (changes skills: private servers only). repaints: the identity keeps its own body and skills and is redrawn as another character. tints: the identity keeps its own body and drawings, recolored. bosses: the identity becomes a boss - the boss's own body and skills (needs the Limbus Private Server's client patch, build 6). identities: a new identity of our own, cloned from a base (with \"source\"/\"unit\": a boss's own body and skills - an ally). kits: an identity's moves and text only, for a body mod's character. \"card\": the identity's ID card pictures drawn from the player's own card art (<data dir>/art/cards/<name>/), while the skin is on. \"unlock\": waits for the private server's Black Forest. \"dupe_of\": the same character in the same body as that skin - one copy is on at a time (a skin with an \"ally\" is one with it; \"ally_dupe_of\" names the ally's own copy). Nothing here is game art; everything is built from your own installed game.",
